Package: com.legacy.viberlegacytls
Name: ViberLegacy TLS Compatibility
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Forces iOS 5 compatible TLS stream settings for the Viber app so legacy builds can reach modern *.viber.com hosts without an external proxy. Version-agnostic: filters by bundle id and hooks CFNetwork, not app offsets.
Author: legacy
Maintainer: legacy
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate
